226
00:09:59,200 --> 00:10:00,820
del municipi en un sol estiu.

227
00:10:01,680 --> 00:10:02,820
No fer cas a l'auditor

228
00:10:02,820 --> 00:10:05,620
demostra zero planificació al llarg termini.

229
00:10:05,820 --> 00:10:07,300
I si aprofundim

230
00:10:07,300 --> 00:10:08,980
