242
00:10:30,840 --> 00:10:33,160
20 arbres madurs a l'Alt de l'Ella.

243
00:10:33,760 --> 00:10:34,780
L'excusa oficial.

244
00:10:35,400 --> 00:10:37,100
Que necessiten pavimentar per fer

245
00:10:37,100 --> 00:10:38,560
27 places d'aparcament.

246
00:10:39,160 --> 00:10:41,760
I clar, la gent es queixa o el projecte falla

247
00:10:41,760 --> 00:10:43,160
