274
00:11:33,360 --> 00:11:34,820
Un monument natural, vaja.

275
00:11:35,160 --> 00:11:37,340
I tant. Doncs va ser esborrat

276
00:11:37,340 --> 00:11:39,300
del mapa, sense data de tala,

277
00:11:39,600 --> 00:11:41,320
sense expedient públic i sense

278
00:11:41,320 --> 00:11:43,220
un informe que en avali la necessitat.

279
00:11:43,600 --> 00:11:44,660
Simplement desapareix.

280
00:11:44,940 --> 00:11:47,540
I el més greu és que tenim un catàlog de patrimoni

281
00:11:47,540 --> 00:11:48,620
