286
00:11:57,720 --> 00:11:58,040
Zero.

287
00:11:58,380 --> 00:12:00,000
Zero. Cap niu.

288
00:12:00,640 --> 00:12:02,140
Ni el lledoner de la Casa Alta,

289
00:12:02,520 --> 00:12:03,780
ni els plàtans de Can Goix.

290
