320
00:13:05,520 --> 00:13:07,060
Xuclen aigua, la pugen

321
00:13:07,060 --> 00:13:09,400
a les fulles i la liberen com a vapor.

322
00:13:09,960 --> 00:13:11,440
Això roba calor a aire.

323
00:13:11,940 --> 00:13:13,060
L'arbre refreda

324
00:13:13,060 --> 00:13:14,860
