00:15:45,100 --> 00:15:46,780
aquest dossier imprescindible sobre la

401
00:15:46,780 --> 00:15:49,020
realitat del nostre bosc urbà. Moltíssimes

402
00:15:49,020 --> 00:15:50,660
gràcies per posar claretat a tot aquest

403
00:15:50,660 --> 00:15:52,800
